76eb3922.mp4?t=1725418185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>YOU ARE REBORN INTO A DESOLATE UNIVERSE, <br>ABOARD AN ANCIENT BIOMECHANICAL STARSHIP.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483350/extras/904dbce427142abdfdf7d95a16a6f4ef.poster.avif?t=1725418185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483350/extras/904dbce427142abdfdf7d95a16a6f4ef.webm?t=1725418185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483350/extras/904dbce427142abdfdf7d95a16a6f4ef.mp4?t=1725418185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>REGENESIS ULTIMATUM is a short bio-industrial permadeath horror game set in a dead universe where every planet is barren, every sun is burned out. Only one bastion of life remains; threatened by an unfathomable entity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483350/extras/f98d99757fc22449786766e7a28d93af.poster.avif?t=1725418185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483350/extras/f98d99757fc22449786766e7a28d93af.webm?t=1725418185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483350/extras/f98d99757fc22449786766e7a28d93af.mp4?t=1725418185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
